  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Higher Education Development Policy Program - Third Operation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HEDPO3 aims to strengthen governance, financing and quality of higher education by (i) improving the responsiveness of higher education and research and increase the quantitative capacity of the system; (ii) enhancing fiscal transparency, sustainability and effectiveness of the higher education sector; and (iii) improving the quality of Higher Education institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
